<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
<p class="updated">Effective date: October 31, 2026</p>

<p>This Privacy Policy describes how Sac AI Receptionist ("we," "us," or "our") collects, uses, and protects the information you provide when you use our website at <a href="https://sacaireceptionist.com">sacaireceptionist.com</a> or contact us about our service.</p>

<h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
<p>When you submit the free trial request form, we collect:</p>
<ul>
<li>Your name</li>
<li>Business name</li>
<li>Phone number</li>
<li>Email address (optional)</li>
<li>Business type</li>
<li>Estimated weekly missed calls</li>
<li>Any additional notes you choose to include</li>
</ul>

<h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
<p>We use the information you provide solely to:</p>
<ul>
<li>Contact you to set up your free 14-day trial</li>
<li>Send you a confirmation text message acknowledging receipt of your request</li>
<li>Follow up about your trial experience</li>
<li>Answer questions and provide support related to the service</li>
</ul>
<p>We do not sell, rent, or share your personal information with third parties for marketing purposes.</p>

<h2>3. SMS / Text Messaging</h2>
<div class="highlight">
<strong>SMS Consent:</strong> By checking the SMS consent box on our request form, you agree to receive text messages from Sac AI Receptionist at the phone number you provided. Your consent is not a condition of purchasing any goods or services.
</div>
<p>When you opt in to SMS:</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Message types:</strong> We may send a confirmation text when we receive your request, and follow-up messages about setting up your trial.</li>
<li><strong>Frequency:</strong> Message frequency varies. Typically no more than a few messages related to your trial setup.</li>
<li><strong>Rates:</strong> Message and data rates may apply depending on your mobile carrier plan.</li>
<li><strong>Opt out:</strong> Reply <strong>STOP</strong> at any time to stop receiving text messages from us. After opting out, you will receive one final confirmation message.</li>
<li><strong>Help:</strong> Reply <strong>HELP</strong> for assistance, or contact us at <a href="mailto:wahmed07860786@gmail.com">wahmed07860786@gmail.com</a>.</li>
</ul>
<p>Mobile opt-in data is never shared with third parties or affiliates for their own marketing purposes.</p>

<h2>4. Data Retention</h2>
<p>We retain your contact information only as long as needed to provide the requested service or as required by law. If you decide not to proceed with a trial or cancel at any time, you may request deletion of your data by contacting us.</p>

<h2>5. Security</h2>
<p>We take reasonable precautions to protect your information. Your data is stored securely and access is limited to those who need it to operate the service.</p>

