<li><strong>Render</strong> — to host our web application. Render's privacy policy is available at <a href="https://render.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">render.com/privacy</a>.</li>
</ul>
<p>These services receive only the information necessary to deliver the functionality they provide.</p>

<h2>7. Your Rights</h2>
<p>You may contact us at any time to:</p>
<ul>
<li>Request access to the personal information we hold about you</li>
<li>Request correction of inaccurate data</li>
